<title>USA: HORSE RACING-PREAKNESS FINISH.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-PREAKNESS FINISH.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1997-05-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Order of finish at the 122nd running of the Preakness Stakes on Saturday (list under horse, jockey and trainer:</p>
<p>1. Silver Charm, Gary Stevens, Bob Baffert</p>
<p>2. Free House, Kent Desormeaux, Paco Gonzalez</p>
<p>3. Captain Bodgit, Alex Solis, Gary Capuano</p>
<p>4. Touch Gold, Chris McCarron, David Hofmans</p>
<p>5. Frisk Me Now, Eddie King Jr., Bob Durso</p>
<p>6. Concerto, Mike Smith, John Tammaro III</p>
<p>7. Hoxie, Jose Santos, Alfredo Callejas</p>
<p>8. Wild Tempest, Joe Bravo, Nick Zito</p>
<p>9. Cryp Too, C.C. Lopez, Allen Borosh</p>
<p>10. Jack At the Bank, Herb McCauley, Alfredo Callejas</p>
</text>
